<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="0" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject"><bpt id="1" rid="1">&lt;mq:rxt displaytext=&quot;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&quot; val=&quot;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&quot;&gt;</bpt>The feature is designed for scenarios where <bpt id="2" rid="2">&lt;mq:rxt displaytext=&quot;&amp;lt;b&amp;gt;&quot; val=&quot;&amp;lt;b&amp;gt;&quot;&gt;</bpt>different languages require different sentence boundaries<ept id="3" rid="2">&lt;/mq:rxt displaytext=&quot;&amp;lt;/b&amp;gt;&quot; val=&quot;&amp;lt;/b&amp;gt;&quot;&gt;</ept>.<ept id="4" rid="1">&lt;/mq:rxt displaytext=&quot;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&quot; val=&quot;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&quot;&gt;</ept></source>
